<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-COPA CENTENARIO RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COPA CENTENARIO RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BELO HORIZONTE, Brazil 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Copa</p>
<p>Centenario group B matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Cruzeiro (Brazil) 1 Olimpia (Paraguay) 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Geovani</p>
<p>Flamengo (Brazil) 5 Benfica (Portugal) 2 (2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Flamengo - Savio, Iranildo, Lucio, Rodrigo, Fabio Baiano</p>
<p>Benfica - Erwin Sanchez, Paulo Nunes</p>
<p>Standings</p>
<p>		    P  W  D  L  F  A Pts</p>
<p> Cruzeiro	 2  2  0  0  5  1  6</p>
<p> Flamengo	 2  1  1  0  7  4  4</p>
<p> Olimpia	  2  0  1  1  2  3  1</p>
<p> Benfica	  2  0  0  2  3  9  0</p>
<p>Note: the tournament is being played to celebrate the 100th</p>
<p>founding of the anniversary of the city. The winners of group A</p>
<p>and B meet in the final.</p>
</text>
